## Most-used commands

| Command | What it does | When |
|---|---|---|
| `README.md` | Print this map + every installed skill | "remind me what's here" |
| `/brainstorm [topic]` | Conversational ideation → plan file | start of any feature |
| `/sdlc {plan}` | Autonomous plan-to-PR pipeline (commits + PR) | plan is bounded + clear |
| `/sdlc-lite <X>` | Full pipeline, hands you the changes to commit (no git writes) | full discipline, you commit (e.g. onto an open PR) |
| `/task "..."` | One-row TDD task | a single bug or small change |
| `/status` | What to do now, from run state + sentinel + TASKS.md | after any interruption |
| `/status` | Classify a paused run, draft the fix | a pipeline run went red |
| `/status` | Current run state | mid-pipeline check-in |
| `/repo-health` | Hygiene sweep + score | weekly, or pre-release |
| `/test-check` | Run tests + log audit | before shipping |
| `/flowsim {plan}` | Plan-vs-code drift check | post-merge sanity |
| `/gotcha "..."` | Append a pitfall (auto-drafted at loop-exit on real traps) | after a bug bites |
| `/repo-onboarding` | Regenerate AGENTS.md / project.json | new repo intake |
| `/dead-code-review` | Multi-agent unused-code scan | pre-cleanup, monthly |

