## Config files (all optional, all gitignored or user-owned)

| File | Owner | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` | You | Repo-wide agent instructions. Skip-on-exist; setup.sh writes a template only on first install. |
| `TASKS.md` | You | Portable task tracker (markdown checkboxes). Toolkit reads and appends rows; you curate. |
| `GOTCHAS.md` | You | Project-specific pitfalls. `/gotcha` appends; you curate. |
| `.claude/project.json` | You | Test commands, log audit, eval runner, modules, plus the `models` / `agents` / `pipeline` blocks. Every key optional; skills skip gracefully when absent. Start from `.claude/project.json.example`. |
| `.claude/pipeline/<slug>/` | Toolkit | Run journals (`run.json` + per-stage sidecars). Gitignored. Drives `--resume`, `/status`, `/status`. |
| `.claude/.next-action` | Toolkit | The seam: JSON-lines `{cmd, source, confirm}` the Stop hook surfaces as `Next: …` and then consumes. Gitignored. |

