## The seam + long loops

```
  A skill writes .claude/.next-action  →  the Stop hook prints "Next: <cmd>"
  and deletes it (fire-once). With pipeline.loop.auto_continue: true it
  EXECUTES a single non-confirm entry instead, bounded by
  pipeline.loop.max_hops. A confirm:true entry is NEVER auto-run.

  /sdlc-lite <plan> --queue [N]   attended backlog loop; re-scans TASKS.md
                                  between items so work added mid-run joins
  scripts/loop-runner.sh          same loop, but a FRESH headless process
                                  every pipeline.loop.batch_size items, so
                                  context resets at a clean item boundary
```

