## Troubleshooting

- **No `Next: /...` hint after a skill** → the Stop hook isn't wired. The
  plugin ships it, and `setup.sh` installs it unless you passed `--no-hooks`.
  On Codex you must also **trust** the `.codex/` dir via `/hooks` — hooks do
  not fire until you do.
- **A skill's behavior doesn't match this map** → run `README.md
  <skill-name>` for the live SKILL.md. This template can drift; the
  SKILL.md files are authoritative.
- **`/sdlc` complains about missing config** → `.claude/project.json`
  needs `test.unit` (or whatever stage 5 references). Copy from
  `.claude/project.json.example` and fill in.
- **A config key seems to do nothing** → check it against
  `skills/sdlc/templates/models.md`. The model/count keys were consolidated
  into the top-level `models` and `agents` blocks; old `pipeline.*.model`
  keys are no longer read and fall back to the built-in default.
- **`--model opus` didn't speed up / strengthen a stage** → the cap is a
  ceiling and can only lower. A stage whose built-in tier is Haiku is raised
  only by its per-stage key (`models.sanity`, `models.plan_review`).
- **A new skill isn't in this map** → it landed after this template was
  generated. `README.md` will show it; edit this file to keep the map
  current.
